name: tech-digest
description: "Weekly Thursday 9AM tech+AI digest from HN, Reddit, RSS"
cron: "0 9 * * 4"
timezone: "America/New_York"
steps:
  - tool: web_fetch
    label: hn-top
    input:
      url: "https://hacker-news.firebaseio.com/v0/topstories.json"
  - tool: web_fetch
    label: reddit-ml
    input:
      url: "https://www.reddit.com/r/MachineLearning/top.json?limit=10&t=week"
  - tool: sessions_send
    label: digest
    input:
      agentId: legacy
      message: |
        WEEKLY TECH DIGEST — post to Discord heartbeat channel.

        Sources:
        - HN top IDs: {{hn-top.output}} — fetch titles for top 20
        - Reddit ML: {{reddit-ml.output}}
        - Also fetch: https://hnrss.org/newest.jsonfeed?q=AI+agent+LLM&count=15

        Score each item 1-10 for OneMind OS relevance. Keep only 7+.

        Post this format to Discord (not DM, use channel 1478596330942107689):
        ===================================
        WEEKLY TECH DIGEST — Week of {date}

        TOP HN THIS WEEK (score >=7):
        1. [title] — relevance 8/10 — {1-line why it matters}
        2. ...

        AI/LLM HIGHLIGHTS:
        - {3-5 stories most relevant to agent systems, voice AI, or automation}

        ONEMIND ACTION ITEMS:
        - {1-2 concrete things we should research or build based on this week}
        ===================================
